        "summon :parameters (?character - person ?g - ismagic ?object - thing ?place - location) :precondition (and (confined ?g) (magic ?object) (at ?character ?place) (has ?character ?object) (in ?g ?object) (alive ?character) (not (= ?character ?g)) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive)) :effect (and (at ?g ?place) (controls ?character ?g ?object) (controls-magic ?character ?object) (not (in ?g ?object)) (not (confined ?g))))": "(:action summon :parameters (?character - person ?g - ismagic ?object - thing ?place - location) :precondition (and (confined ?g) (magic ?object) (at ?character ?place) (has ?character ?object) (in ?g ?object) (alive ?character) (not (= ?character ?g)) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive)) :effect (and (at ?g ?place) (controls ?character ?g ?object) (controls-magic ?character ?object) (not (in ?g ?object)) (not (confined ?g))))",
        "order :parameters (?king - king ?knight - knight ?location - location ?object - thing) :precondition (and (loyal-to ?knight ?king) (alive ?knight) (alive ?king) (at ?king ?location) (at ?knight ?location)) :effect (and (intends-has ?knight ?king ?object)))": "(:action order :parameters (?king - king ?knight - knight ?location - location ?object - thing) :precondition (and (loyal-to ?knight ?king) (alive ?knight) (alive ?king) (at ?king ?location) (at ?knight ?location)) :effect (and (intends-has ?knight ?king ?object)))",
        "command :parameters (?character - person ?g - genie ?love - person ?object - thing ?place - location) :precondition (and (magic ?object) (has ?character ?object) (controls ?character ?g ?object) (alive ?character) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive) (alive ?love) (at ?character ?place) (at ?g ?place) (loves ?character ?love) (not (loves ?love ?character)) (not (= ?character ?g)) (not (= ?character ?love))) :effect (and (intends-loves ?g ?love ?character)))": "(:action command :parameters (?character - person ?g - genie ?love - person ?object - thing ?place - location) :precondition (and (magic ?object) (has ?character ?object) (controls ?character ?g ?object) (alive ?character) (magic-char ?g) (magic-char-alive) (alive ?love) (at ?character ?place) (at ?g ?place) (loves ?character ?love) (not (loves ?love ?character)) (not (= ?character ?g)) (not (= ?character ?love))) :effect (and (intends-loves ?g ?love ?character)))",
